/-!
# The pullback of a triple along a morphism of schemes

Let `A = ⨁_{n ≥ 0} 𝒜 n` be a graded ring. A *triple* over a scheme `Y`, in the sense of Section
27.12, is an integer `d ≥ 1`, an invertible `𝒪_Y`-module `L` and a graded ring map
`ψ : A^{(d)} ⟶ Γ_*(Y, L)` whose degree-`d` values generate `L`. This file constructs the pullback
`(d, h^*L, h^* ∘ ψ)` of a triple along a morphism of schemes `h : Y' ⟶ Y`, where the graded map is
pulled back degreewise by `Stacks.AlgebraicGeometry.ProjChartRatioPullback.pullSection`.

## Main definitions

* `Stacks.AlgebraicGeometry.ProjTriplePullback.pullSectionHom`: pulling a global section of
  `L ^⊗ n` back, as an additive map.
* `Stacks.AlgebraicGeometry.ProjTriplePullback.pullbackSections`: the pullback `h^* ∘ ψ` of the
  graded map of a triple, a graded map `A^{(d)} ⟶ Γ_*(Y', h^*L)`.
* `Stacks.AlgebraicGeometry.ProjTriplePullback.pullbackTriple`: the pullback `(d, h^*L, h^* ∘ ψ)`
  of a triple along a morphism of schemes.

## Main results

* `Stacks.AlgebraicGeometry.ProjTriplePullback.nonvanishingOpen_psiSection_pullbackSections`: the
  nonvanishing open of a degree-`d` value of the pulled-back map is the preimage of the
  nonvanishing open of the corresponding value of `ψ`.
* `Stacks.AlgebraicGeometry.ProjTriplePullback.iSup_nonvanishingOpen_pullbackSections`: `h^*L` is
  generated by the degree-`d` values of `h^* ∘ ψ`.

## Implementation notes

The graded map of a triple is spelled as
`Stacks.AlgebraicGeometry.ProjChartFromRatios.VeroneseSections`, the spelling in which
`Stacks.AlgebraicGeometry.ProjDegreeOpenRepresents.existsUnique_hom` is stated.

## References

* [Stacks Project, Tag 01N4](https://stacks.math.columbia.edu/tag/01N4)
* [Stacks Project, Tag 01N8](https://stacks.math.columbia.edu/tag/01N8)
* [Stacks Project, Tag 01N9](https://stacks.math.columbia.edu/tag/01N9)
* [Stacks Project, Tag 01CD](https://stacks.math.columbia.edu/tag/01CD)
* [Stacks Project, Tag 0B8L](https://stacks.math.columbia.edu/tag/0B8L)
* [Stacks Project, Tag 0H78](https://stacks.math.columbia.edu/tag/0H78)
-/

@[expose] public noncomputable section

